    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590530/extras/9c950536565299f44d7fa75bce2e79ed.poster.avif?t=1724158158\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590530/extras/9c950536565299f44d7fa75bce2e79ed.webm?t=1724158158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590530/extras/9c950536565299f44d7fa75bce2e79ed.mp4?t=1724158158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dawn of the Wizards is a grid based dungeon crawler RPG inspired by games from the 90\u2019s like Lands of Lore and Eye of the Beholder.<br><br>With a combat twist you will fight enemies with your own weapon of choice focusing on melee interactions, parrying and pure real-time combat action!<br>Spell casting will be affected by your quick use of the mouse in our own unique spell system.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590530/extras/9c950536565299f44d7fa75bce2e79ed.poster.avif?t=1724158158\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590530/extras/9c950536565299f44d7fa75bce2e79ed.webm?t=1724158158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590530/extras/9c950536565299f44d7fa75bce2e79ed.mp4?t=1724158158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dawn of the Wizards is a grid based dungeon crawler RPG inspired by games from the 90\u2019s like Lands of Lore and Eye of the Beholder.<br><br>With a combat twist you will fight enemies with your own weapon of choice focusing on melee interactions, parrying and pure real-time combat action!<br>Spell casting will be affected by your quick use of the mouse in our own unique spell system.",
    "short_description": "Dawn of the Wizards is a grid based dungeon crawler RPG. The game puts its focus on real-time melee combat. Fighting monsters in a dungeon, solving puzzles and exploring the world and events that led to the dawn of the wizards and the downfall of all who opposed them.",
